se in initial sales compared to projections. My proactive adjustments helped secure client satisfaction and avoid potential revenue losses.","I collaborated with the team to prioritize high-impact elements and negotiated lower costs with vendors, in response to in my last role, we faced a 25% budget cut during a major campaign. My role was to revise the campaign strategy to meet new constraints, resulting in as a result, we stayed within budget and achieved 90% of our original engagement goals."]', 30, '2026-08-09T23:54:04.557Z', '2026-08-10T01:19:05.467Z');
